---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { musicTracks } from "../../data/music/tracks";
import "../../styles/music.css";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<SiteLayout
  title="音乐"
  description="《東方七日祭》Music Room：收录道中曲、Boss 曲与角色相关音乐。"
>
  <div class="site-shell">
    <header class="page-head music-head">
      <p class="section-kicker">Music Room</p>
      <h1>音乐</h1>
      <p>七天里走过的路、遇见的人和打过的架，都各有自己的声音。试听只会在你主动点击以后播放。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="music-room" aria-labelledby="music-list-title">
      <div class="music-room-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Soundtrack</p>
          <h2 id="music-list-title">曲目</h2>
        </div>
        <p>当前先整理已经定下来的曲目。公开试听文件补进站点后，这里会直接出现播放器。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="music-list">
        {musicTracks.map((track, index) => (
          <article class="music-track" id={track.id}>
            <div class="music-track-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</div>

            <div class="music-track-copy">
              <div class="music-track-meta">
                <span>{track.kindLabel}</span>
                {track.day && <span>Day {track.day}</span>}
                {track.character && <span class="music-track-character">{track.character}</span>}
              </div>
              <h3>
                {track.title}
                <span aria-hidden="true"> ～ </span>
                <span class="music-track-en">{track.titleEn}</span>
              </h3>
              <p>{track.description}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="music-track-player">
              {track.versions.map((version) => (
                <div class="music-version">
                  <div class="music-version-head">
                    <span>{version.label ?? "试听"}</span>
                    <span>{version.duration}</span>
                  </div>
                  {version.audioPath ? (
                    <audio controls preload="metadata" src={base + version.audioPath}>
                      你的浏览器不支持音频播放。
                    </audio>
                  ) : (
                    <div class="music-preview-pending" aria-label="试听文件待发布">
                      <span class="music-preview-icon" aria-hidden="true">♪</span>
                      <div>
                        <strong>试听文件待发布</strong>
                        <span>音频版本已登记，文件补入后即可播放。</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <p class="music-room-note">本站不会自动播放音乐。试听版将使用适合网页加载的压缩音频，母带文件不放在站点仓库里。</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
